":ref:`confrontare e differenziare i costi di acquisto <inventory/"
"product_management/view-valuation>` in base a lotti o numeri di serie"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots.rst:10
msgid ""
"Track the actual cost of manufactured products, based on the real cost of "
