msgstr "Gestire le ubicazioni predefinite per ciascun prodotto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:22
msgid ""
"Defining warehouse movement for quality control, after-sales services, or "
"supplier returns."
msgstr ""
"Definire i movimenti di magazzino per il controllo qualità, i servizi post-"
"vendita o i resi ai fornitori."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:23
msgid "Helping rental management automate return moves for rented products."
msgstr ""
"Aiutare la gestione noleggi ad automatizzare i movimenti di reso per i "
"prodotti noleggiati."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:26
msgid ""
"`Odoo Tutorials: Push & Pull Rules <https://www.youtube.com/watch?"
"v=qkhDUezyZuc>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Tutorial Odoo: Regole Push & Pull <https://www.youtube.com/watch?"
