#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:27
msgid ":doc:`Standard routes in Odoo <../daily_operations>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Rotte standard in Odoo <../daily_operations>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:34
msgid ""
"To access routes and select them on products, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Settings`. In the "
"*Warehouse* section, ensure the :guilabel:`Multi-Step Routes` "
"and :guilabel:`Storage Locations` features are enabled, then "
"click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Per accedere alle rotte e selezionarle nei prodotti, andare "
"su :menuselection:`App Magazzino --> Configurazione --> Impostazioni`. Nella "
"sezione *Magazzino*, accertarsi che le funzionalità :guilabel:`Rotte a più "
"fasi` e :guilabel:`Ubicazioni di stoccaggio` siano abilitate, quindi fare "
"clic su :guilabel:`Salva`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:38
msgid ""
"Additionally, routes are generated depending on the warehouse's reception "
"and delivery configurations. To access these settings, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> Warehouses` and "
"select the relevant warehouse. In the *Warehouse Configuration* tab, enable "
"the desired inbound and outbound flows in the :guilabel:`Incoming Shipments` "
"and :guilabel:`Outgoing Shipments` fields."
msgstr ""
"Inoltre, le rotte vengono generate in base alle configurazioni di ricezione "
"e consegna del magazzino. Per accedere a queste impostazioni, andare "
"su :menuselection:`App Magazzino --> Configurazione --> Magazzini` e "
"selezionare il magazzino pertinente. Nella scheda *Configurazione "
"magazzino*, abilitare i flussi in entrata e in uscita desiderati nei "
"campi :guilabel:`Spedizioni in entrata` e :guilabel:`Spedizioni in uscita`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:45
msgid ""
"To use 1-step, 2-step, or 3-step receptions or deliveries, only "
"the :guilabel:`Incoming Shipments` and :guilabel:`Outgoing Shipments` fields "
"should be set. Do **not** create or modify rules to set up these flows."
msgstr ""
"Per utilizzare ricezioni o consegne a 1 fase, 2 fasi o 3 fasi, devono essere "
"impostati solo i campi :guilabel:`Spedizioni in entrata` "
"e :guilabel:`Spedizioni in uscita`. **Non** creare o modificare regole per "
"configurare questi flussi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:50
msgid ":doc:`../../warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:55
msgid "Standard warehouse routes"
msgstr "Rotte standard del magazzino"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:57
msgid ""
"Odoo automatically generates warehouse routes based on "
"the :guilabel:`Incoming Shipments` and :guilabel:`Outgoing Shipments` fields "
"of the warehouse. These routes automatically apply to every product in the "
"warehouse, and do **not** need to be :ref:`manually applied <inventory/"
"routes/apply>` on individual products."
msgstr ""
"Odoo genera automaticamente le rotte del magazzino in base ai "
"campi :guilabel:`Spedizioni in entrata` e :guilabel:`Spedizioni in uscita` "
"del magazzino. Queste rotte si applicano automaticamente a ogni prodotto del "
"magazzino e **non** devono essere :ref:`applicate manualmente <inventory/"
"routes/apply>` ai singoli prodotti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:62
msgid ""
"Depending on the route, products move through the following warehouse "
"locations, where `<WH>` is the warehouse's short name:"
msgstr ""
"A seconda della rotta, i prodotti si spostano attraverso le seguenti "
"ubicazioni di magazzino, dove `<WH>` corrisponde al nome breve del magazzino:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:65
msgid "|ST|: The main stock location, used by all flows."
msgstr ""
"|ST|: l'ubicazione di stoccaggio principale, utilizzata da tutti i flussi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:66
msgid ""
"|IN|: Where products are received before being stored. Used in 2-step and 3-"
"step receptions."
msgstr ""
"|IN|: dove vengono ricevuti i prodotti prima di essere stoccati. Utilizzata "
"nelle ricezioni a 2 e 3 fasi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:67
msgid "|QC|: Where received products are checked. Used in 3-step receptions."
msgstr ""
"|QC|: dove vengono controllati i prodotti ricevuti. Utilizzata nelle "
"ricezioni a 3 fasi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:68
msgid "|PACK|: Where picked products are packed. Used in 3-step deliveries."
msgstr ""
"|PACK|: dove vengono imballati i prodotti prelevati. Utilizzata nelle "
"consegne a 3 fasi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:69
msgid ""
"|OUT|: Where products wait before being shipped. Used in 2-step and 3-step "
"deliveries."
msgstr ""
"|OUT|: dove i prodotti attendono prima di essere spediti. Utilizzata nelle "
"consegne in 2 e 3 fasi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations/use_routes.rst:71
msgid ""
"Odoo activates and archives these locations automatically when the warehouse "
"options change."
msgstr ""
"Odoo attiva e archivia automaticamente queste ubicazioni quando le opzioni "
"del magazzino cambiano."

