#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:3
msgid "DHL integration"
msgstr "Integrazione DHL"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:5
msgid ""
"Set up the DHL shipping connector in Odoo to manage DHL shipments to clients "
"directly within Odoo. Configuring a DHL shipping method simplifies the "
"process of :doc:`calculating shipping rates <../setup_configuration>` "
"and :doc:`generating shipping labels <labels>`."
msgstr ""
"Configura il connettore di spedizione DHL in Odoo per gestire le spedizioni "
"DHL ai clienti direttamente in Odoo. Configurare un metodo di spedizione DHL "
"semplifica il processo di :doc:`calcolo delle tariffe di spedizione <../"
"setup_configuration>` e :doc:`generazione delle etichette di spedizione "
"<labels>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:13
msgid "Configure the DHL shipping method"
msgstr "Configura il metodo di spedizione DHL"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:15
msgid ""
"To enable DHL delivery methods, :ref:`install <general/install>` the **DHL "
"Express Shipping** module. DHL delivery methods can be configured and added "
"as a line item to sales orders, which allows for automatic computation of "
"shipping rates and generation of shipping labels."
msgstr ""
"Per abilitare i metodi di consegna DHL, :ref:`installare <general/install>` "
"il modulo **Spedizione espressa DHL**. I metodi di consegna DHL possono "
"essere configurati e aggiunti come voce agli ordini di vendita, consentendo "
"il calcolo automatico delle tariffe di spedizione e la generazione delle "
"etichette di spedizione."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:19
msgid ""
"To create a DHL shipping method, navigate to :menuselection:`Inventory app --"
"> Configuration --> Delivery Methods`, then click :guilabel:`New` to open a "
"delivery method form. If a shipping method has already been created, it can "
"be selected from this screen."
msgstr ""
"Per creare un metodo di spedizione DHL, andare in :menuselection:`App "
"Magazzino --> Configurazione --> Metodi di consegna`, quindi fare clic "
"su :guilabel:`Nuovo` per aprire un modulo del metodo di consegna. Se un "
"metodo di spedizione è già stato creato, può essere selezionato da questa "
"schermata."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:23
msgid "The form for a DHL shipping method."
msgstr "Il modulo per un metodo di spedizione DHL."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:27
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/fedex.rst:50
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/usps.rst:70
msgid "General information"
msgstr "Informazioni generali"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:29
msgid ""
"Begin configuring the shipping method by entering its title in "
"the :guilabel:`Shipping Method` field."
msgstr ""
"Iniziare a configurare il metodo di spedizione inserendo il suo titolo nel "
"campo :guilabel:`Metodo di spedizione`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:32
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Provider` drop-down menu, select the :guilabel:`DHL` "
"option, and a new :guilabel:`DHL Configuration` tab appears at the bottom of "
"the form."
msgstr ""
"Nel menu a discesa :guilabel:`Fornitore`, selezionare "
"l'opzione :guilabel:`DHL` e apparirà una nuova "
"scheda :guilabel:`Configurazione DHL` nella parte inferiore del modulo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:35
msgid ""
"All other fields in this section are identical on the shipping method forms "
"for each shipping carrier. See :doc:`third-party shippers "
"<third_party_shipper>` for standard configuration instructions."
msgstr ""
"Tutti gli altri campi in questa sezione sono identici nei moduli dei metodi "
"di spedizione per ciascun corriere. Consultare :doc:`corrieri terzi "
"<third_party_shipper>` per le istruzioni di configurazione standard."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:40
msgid "DHL Configuration tab"
msgstr "Scheda Configurazione DHL"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:42
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`DHL Configuration` tab on the shipping method form is used to "
"connect the user's DHL account to Odoo and configure the shipping method's "
"details."
msgstr ""
"La scheda :guilabel:`Configurazione DHL` nel modulo del metodo di spedizione "
"viene utilizzata per connettere l'account DHL dell'utente a Odoo e "
"configurare i dettagli del metodo di spedizione."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:46
msgid "DHL developer credentials"
msgstr "Credenziali sviluppatore DHL"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:48
msgid ""
"To integrate DHL with Odoo, developer credentials must be retrieved from "
"DHL's Developer Portal. These credentials are used to link the user's DHL "
"account to Odoo's **Inventory** app."
msgstr ""
"Per integrare DHL con Odoo, è necessario recuperare le credenziali "
"sviluppatore dal portale sviluppatori di DHL. Queste credenziali vengono "
"utilizzate per collegare l'account DHL dell'utente all'app **Magazzino** di "
"Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:52
msgid ""
"The *SiteID* and *Password* are different credentials from the ones used to "
"log in to a DHL account."
msgstr ""
"Il *SiteID* e la *Password* sono credenziali diverse da quelle utilizzate "
"per accedere a un account DHL."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:56
msgid "With DHL Express Account"
msgstr "Con account DHL Express"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:58
msgid ""
"If a DHL Express account is available, log in to the `DHL Developer portal "
"<https://developer.dhl.com/api-reference/dhl-express-mydhl-api#get-started-"
"section/ user-guide%get-access>`_ and `request a DHL API account number "
"<https://developer.dhl. com/form/dhl-express-onboarding>`_."
msgstr ""
"Se è disponibile un account DHL Express, accedere al `portale sviluppatori "
"DHL <https://developer.dhl.com/api-reference/dhl-express-mydhl-api#get-"
"started-section/ user-guide%get-access>`_ e `richiedere un numero di account "
"API DHL <https://developer.dhl. com/form/dhl-express-onboarding>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:63
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:85
msgid ""
"Then, in Odoo, on the shipping method form, enter the *DHL API Key* in "
"the :guilabel:`DHL SiteID` field, and the *API Secret* in the :guilabel:`DHL "
"Password` field."
msgstr ""
"Quindi, in Odoo, nel modulo del metodo di spedizione, inserire la *chiave "
"API DHL* nel campo :guilabel:`SiteID DHL` e il *segreto API* nel "
"campo :guilabel:`Password DHL`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:67
msgid "Without DHL Express Account"
msgstr "Senza account DHL Express"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:69
msgid "If a DHL Express account is **not** available:"
msgstr "Se un account DHL Express **non** è disponibile:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:71
msgid ""
"Begin by opening a `DHL Express account <https://mydhl.express.dhl/gb/en/"
"ship/open-account.html#/fs-step=connectors&fs-step=connectors>`_."
msgstr ""
"Iniziare aprendo un `account DHL Express <https://mydhl.express.dhl/gb/en/"
"ship/open-account.html#/fs-step=connectors&fs-step=connectors>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:73
msgid ""
"Once the developer portal account has been confirmed, log in to the portal "
"using the username and password. Click the user avatar in the top-right "
"corner of the screen to open the user dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Una volta confermato l'account del portale sviluppatori, accedere al portale "
"utilizzando nome utente e password. Cliccare sull'avatar dell'utente "
"nell'angolo in alto a destra dello schermo per aprire la dashboard utente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:75
msgid ""
"On the dashboard, open the :guilabel:`Apps` tab, and create an app. Follow "
"the four steps in the app creation flow (app name, needed apps, app status, "
"confirmation) to complete the setup."
msgstr ""
"Nella dashboard, aprire la scheda :guilabel:`App` e creare un'app. Seguire i "
"quattro passaggi del flusso di creazione dell'app (nome app, app necessarie, "
"stato app, conferma) per completare la configurazione."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:78
msgid "Setup to create DHL account."
msgstr "Configurazione per creare l'account DHL."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dhl_credentials.rst:81
msgid ""
"After setting up the DHL Express account, go `here <https://"
"developer.dhl.com/user/login?destination=/form/dhl-express-onboarding>`_ to "
"get the *DHL API Key* and *API Secret* credentials."
msgstr ""
