":guilabel:`Spedizione banchina`: apre la vista calendario settimanale delle "
"operazioni in lotto pianificate"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:237
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Batches by Route`: Kanban view of batches grouped by fulfillment "
"route"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Lotti per percorso`: vista Kanban dei lotti raggruppati per "
"percorso di evasione"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:238
msgid ":guilabel:`Calendar`: open hourly calendar view of scheduled operations"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Calendario`: apre la vista calendario oraria delle operazioni "
"pianificate"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:239
msgid ":guilabel:`Statistics`: open pivot table of the batch transfers"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Statistiche`: apre la tabella pivot dei trasferimenti in lotto"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:241
msgid "Show prepare batch option from the Transport Management drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Mostrare l'opzione prepara lotto dal menu a discesa Gestione trasporti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:247
msgid "Batch form"
msgstr "Modulo batch"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:249
msgid "On the batch transfer form, fill the following fields out accordingly:"
msgstr ""
"Nel modulo del trasferimento batch, compilare i seguenti campi di "
"conseguenza:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:251
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Responsible`: Assign an employee to the picking. Leave blank if "
"*any* worker can fulfill this picking."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Responsabile`: assegna un dipendente al prelievo. Lascia il campo "
"vuoto se *qualsiasi* lavoratore può eseguire questo prelievo;"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:255
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Scheduled Date`: Specify the date by which "
"the :guilabel:`Responsible` person should complete the transfer to the "
"output location."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Data pianificata`: specifica la data entro la quale "
"il :guilabel:`responsabile` deve completare il trasferimento nell'ubicazione "
"di uscita;"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:257
msgid ":guilabel:`Dock Location`: Select the loading location."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Ubicazione baia`: seleziona l'ubicazione di carico;"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:258
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Vehicle`: Select the vehicle, which will auto-fill "
"the :guilabel:`Vehicle Category`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Veicolo`: seleziona il veicolo e la :guilabel:`Categoria veicolo` "
"verrà compilata automaticamente;"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:259
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Vehicle Category`: Determine if the order exceeds "
"the :ref:`vehicle's capacity limits <inventory/shipping_receiving/vehicle-"
"capacity>`"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Categoria veicolo`: determina se l'ordine supera i :ref:`limiti "
"di capacità del veicolo <inventory/shipping_receiving/vehicle-capacity>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:263
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Volume` bar indicates that the transport truck is nearing "
"capacity."
msgstr ""
"La barra accanto al campo :guilabel:`Volume` indica che il camion di "
"trasporto ha quasi raggiunto la capacità massima."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:265
msgid "Show batch form."
msgstr "Mostra modulo batch."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:271
msgid "Prepare delivery route"
msgstr "Preparare il percorso di consegna"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:273
msgid ""
"To help the driver prepare, click the :guilabel:`Map` button at the top of "
"the batch or wave form to view delivery destinations on a map. Selecting an "
"individual delivery order pinpoints its location."
msgstr ""
"Per aiutare il conducente a prepararsi, fare clic sul "
"pulsante :guilabel:`Mappa` nella parte superiore del modulo batch o wave per "
"visualizzare le destinazioni di consegna su una mappa. Selezionando un "
"singolo ordine di consegna se ne individua la posizione."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:277
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Map` button is only visible for transfers with "
"the :guilabel:`In progress` status."
msgstr ""
"Il pulsante :guilabel:`Mappa` è visibile solo per i trasferimenti con "
"stato :guilabel:`In corso`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:279
msgid "Show map in Odoo, with information of the delivery orders."
msgstr "Mostra mappa in Odoo, con informazioni sugli ordini di consegna."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:282
msgid ""
"Additionally, use the :guilabel:`View in Google Maps` button to generate a "
"route from the warehouse to the delivery points."
msgstr ""
"Inoltre, utilizzare il pulsante :guilabel:`Visualizza in Google Maps` per "
"generare un percorso dal magazzino ai punti di consegna."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:285
msgid "Show Google Map route."
msgstr "Mostra percorso Google Map."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:289
msgid "Prepare consignment note (CMR)"
msgstr "Prepara lettera di vettura (CMR)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:291
msgid ""
"The CMR convention (Convention on the Contract for the International "
"Carriage of Goods by Road) governs the transportation of cargo by road. The "
"majority of European states have ratified the convention."
msgstr ""
"La convenzione CMR (Convention on the Contract for the International "
"Carriage of Goods by Road - Convenzione relativa al contratto di trasporto "
"internazionale di merci su strada) disciplina il trasporto di merci su "
"strada. La maggior parte degli stati europei ha ratificato la convenzione."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:295
msgid ""
"A standard waybill or transport document was developed to aid in this "
"treaty. This is called a consignment note (also known as a |CMR| waybill). "
"Senders are required to produce these forms. A waybill consists of four "
"parts:"
msgstr ""
"Per facilitare questo trattato è stata sviluppata una lettera di vettura o "
"documento di trasporto standard. Questa è chiamata lettera di vettura (nota "
"anche come |CMR| waybill). I mittenti sono tenuti a produrre questi moduli. "
"Una lettera di vettura si compone di quattro parti:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:299
msgid "Sender's copy (in red)"
msgstr "Copia del mittente (in rosso)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:300
msgid "Receiver's copy (in blue)"
msgstr "Copia del destinatario (in blu)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:301
msgid "Carrier's copy (in green)"
msgstr "Copia del vettore (in verde)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:302
msgid "Second carrier's copy (in black)"
msgstr "Seconda copia del vettore (in nero)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:304
msgid ""
"Odoo completes these forms using the information it has; any additional "
"information must be added manually."
msgstr ""
"Odoo completa questi moduli utilizzando le informazioni in suo possesso; "
"eventuali informazioni aggiuntive devono essere aggiunte manualmente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:308
msgid "Single-delivery |CMR|"
msgstr "Consegna singola |CMR|"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:310
msgid ""
"Print a |CMR| for a delivery order by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Operations --> Deliveries`. Open the "
"delivery order that requires a consignment note."
msgstr ""
"Stampa un |CMR| per un ordine di consegna accedendo a "
":menuselection:`Inventario --> Operazioni --> Consegne`. Apri l'ordine di "
"consegna che richiede una lettera di vettura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:313
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Actions)` icon, then select :icon:`fa-"
"print` :menuselection:`Print --> Consignment Note (CMR)`. A consignment note "
"is generated."
msgstr ""
"Fai clic sull'icona :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Azioni)`, quindi seleziona "
":icon:`fa-print` :menuselection:`Stampa --> Lettera di vettura (CMR)`. Viene "
"generata una lettera di vettura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:316
msgid "A CMR note for a shipment of produce, going to Belgium."
msgstr "Una nota CMR per una spedizione di prodotti, diretta in Belgio."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:320
msgid "Batch delivery |CMR|"
msgstr "Consegna raggruppata |CMR|"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:322
msgid ""
"Print |CMRs| for a batch order by navigating to :menuselection:`Inventory "
"app --> Operations --> Batch Transfers`. Open the batch transfer that "
"requires consignment notes."
msgstr ""
"Stampare |CMRs| per un ordine raggruppato andando su :menuselection:`App "
"Inventario --> Operazioni --> Trasferimenti raggruppati`. Aprire il "
"trasferimento raggruppato che richiede le lettere di vettura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/dispatch.rst:325
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Actions)` icon, then select :icon:`fa-"
"print` :menuselection:`Print --> Consignment Note (CMR)`. A consignment note "
"is generated for each delivery in the batch transfer."
msgstr ""
"Fare clic sull'icona :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Azioni)`, quindi "
"selezionare :icon:`fa-print` :menuselection:`Stampa --> Lettera di vettura "
"(CMR)`. Viene generata una lettera di vettura per ogni consegna del "
"trasferimento raggruppato."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:3
msgid "EasyPost integration"
msgstr "Integrazione EasyPost"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:5
msgid ""
"Set up the EasyPost delivery connector in Odoo to manage EasyPost shipments "
"to clients directly within Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Configurare il connettore di consegna EasyPost in Odoo per gestire le "
"spedizioni EasyPost ai clienti direttamente all'interno di Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:8
msgid ""
"EasyPost is a service that allows users to connect with multiple carriers, "
"like UPS, USPS, FedEx, DHL, and more. Odoo can then connect to EasyPost to "
"purchase labels from those carriers."
msgstr ""
"EasyPost è un servizio che consente agli utenti di connettersi con più "
"corrieri, come UPS, USPS, FedEx, DHL e altri. Odoo può quindi connettersi a "
"EasyPost per acquistare etichette da tali corrieri."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:11
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:9
msgid "To configure it, complete these steps:"
msgstr "Per configurarlo, completare questi passaggi:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:13
msgid ""
":ref:`Create an EasyPost account <inventory/shipping_receiving/easypost-"
"account>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Creare un account EasyPost <inventory/shipping_receiving/easypost-"
"account>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:14
msgid ""
":ref:`Integrate carrier accounts if the carrier is not enabled on the "
"EasyPost account <inventory/shipping_receiving/integrate-easypost-carrier>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Integrare gli account dei corrieri se il corriere non è abilitato "
"sull'account EasyPost <inventory/shipping_receiving/integrate-easypost-"
"carrier>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:16
msgid ""
":ref:`Obtain Test and Production API keys <inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"easypost-api-keys>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Ottenere le chiavi API di Test e Produzione <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/easypost-api-keys>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:17
msgid ""
":ref:`Set up the delivery method in Odoo <inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"easypost-method>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Configurare il metodo di consegna in Odoo <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/easypost-method>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:19
msgid ""
"Upon completion, it is possible to calculate shipping costs based on package "
"size and weight, have the charges applied directly to an EasyPost business "
"account, and automatically print EasyPost tracking labels in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Al termine, è possibile calcolare i costi di spedizione in base alle "
"dimensioni e al peso del pacco, applicare gli addebiti direttamente a un "
"account aziendale EasyPost e stampare automaticamente le etichette di "
"tracciamento EasyPost in Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:28
msgid ""
"To begin, go to the `EasyPost <https://www.easypost.com>`__ website to "
"create or log into the company's EasyPost business account."
msgstr ""
"Per iniziare, vai sul sito web di `EasyPost <https://www.easypost.com>`__ "
"per creare o accedere all'account aziendale EasyPost dell'azienda."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:31
msgid ""
"Follow the website's steps to complete registration and sign up for shipping "
"services. Some shipping services (like USPS and DHL Express) are "
"automatically enabled."
msgstr ""
"Segui i passaggi del sito web per completare la registrazione e iscriverti "
"ai servizi di spedizione. Alcuni servizi di spedizione (come USPS e DHL "
"Express) sono abilitati automaticamente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:37
msgid "Integrating other carrier accounts"
msgstr "Integrazione di altri account vettore"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:39
msgid ""
"To use a different carrier, it is possible to `enable Wallet Carrier "
"Accounts <https://support.easypost.com/hc/en-us/articles/21336276718605-"
"Enabling-Wallet-Carriers-Using-the-EasyPost-Dashboard>`__ to purchase labels "
"from EasyPost. Alternatively, if a user has their own carrier account, they "
"can `enable it on EasyPost <https://support.easypost.com/hc/en-us/articles/"
"25246240687373-Bring-Your-Own-Carrier-Account-to-EasyPost>`__. Then, after "
"these accounts are enabled, Odoo can integrate with the EasyPost account and "
"manage labels."
msgstr ""
"Per utilizzare un vettore diverso, è possibile `abilitare gli Account "
"Vettore Wallet <https://support.easypost.com/hc/en-us/articles/"
"21336276718605-Enabling-Wallet-Carriers-Using-the-EasyPost-Dashboard>`__ per "
"acquistare etichette da EasyPost. In alternativa, se un utente ha il proprio "
"account vettore, può `abilitarlo su EasyPost <https://support.easypost.com/"
"hc/en-us/articles/25246240687373-Bring-Your-Own-Carrier-Account-to-"
"EasyPost>`__. Quindi, dopo aver abilitato questi account, Odoo può "
"integrarsi con l'account EasyPost e gestire le etichette."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:50
msgid "Obtain Test and Production API keys"
msgstr "Ottenere le chiavi API di Test e Produzione"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:52
msgid ""
"After completing the setup, create Test and Production API keys. On the "
"EasyPost website, click the :guilabel:`Account Settings` link, then open "
"the :guilabel:`API Keys` page."
msgstr ""
"Dopo aver completato la configurazione, crea le chiavi API di Test e "
"Produzione. Sul sito web di EasyPost, fai clic sul "
"link :guilabel:`Impostazioni account`, quindi apri la "
"pagina :guilabel:`Chiavi API`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:55
msgid ""
"If these API keys have not yet been created, click :guilabel:`Add Additional "
"API Key`. Select either :guilabel:`Production` or :guilabel:`Test`. The API "
"key is automatically created. Follow the same process to create both keys."
msgstr ""
"Se queste chiavi API non sono ancora state create, fai clic "
"su :guilabel:`Aggiungi chiave API aggiuntiva`. "
"Seleziona :guilabel:`Produzione` o :guilabel:`Test`. La chiave API viene "
"creata automaticamente. Segui lo stesso processo per creare entrambe le "
"chiavi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:59
msgid "Create API keys on the EasyPost API Keys page."
msgstr "Crea le chiavi API nella pagina Chiavi API di EasyPost."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:65
msgid "Delivery method configuration"
msgstr "Configurazione del metodo di consegna"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:67
msgid ""
"With those necessary credentials, configure the EasyPost delivery method in "
"Odoo by going to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> "
"Delivery Methods`."
msgstr ""
"Con queste credenziali necessarie, configura il metodo di consegna EasyPost "
"in Odoo andando su :menuselection:`app Magazzino --> Configurazione --> "
"Metodi di consegna`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:70
msgid "On the *Delivery Methods* page, click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr "Nella pagina *Metodi di consegna*, fai clic su :guilabel:`Nuovo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:72
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Provider` field, select :guilabel:`Easypost` from the drop-"
"down menu. Doing so reveals the *Easypost Configuration* tab at the bottom "
"of the form, where the EasyPost API keys should be entered."
msgstr ""
"Nel campo :guilabel:`Fornitore`, seleziona :guilabel:`Easypost` dal menu a "
"discesa. In questo modo viene visualizzata la scheda *Configurazione "
"Easypost* nella parte inferiore del modulo, dove devono essere inserite le "
"chiavi API di EasyPost."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:76
msgid ""
"For details on configuring the other fields on the delivery method, such "
"as :guilabel:`Delivery Product`, refer to the :doc:`new_delivery_method` "
"documentation."
msgstr ""
"Per i dettagli sulla configurazione degli altri campi del metodo di "
"consegna, come :guilabel:`Prodotto di consegna`, fai riferimento alla "
"documentazione :doc:`new_delivery_method`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:80
msgid ""
"To generate EasyPost shipping labels through Odoo, ensure "
"the :guilabel:`Integration Level` option is set to :guilabel:`Get Rate and "
"Create Shipment`."
msgstr ""
"Per generare etichette di spedizione EasyPost tramite Odoo, assicurati che "
"l'opzione :guilabel:`Livello di integrazione` sia impostata "
"su :guilabel:`Ottieni tariffa e crea spedizione`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:83
msgid "In the *Easypost Configuration* tab, complete the following fields:"
msgstr "Nella scheda *Configurazione Easypost*, completa i seguenti campi:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:85
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Test API Key`: the Test API key in the EasyPost Account Settings."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Chiave API di test`: la chiave API di test nelle Impostazioni "
"account di EasyPost."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:86
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Production API Key`: the Production API key in the EasyPost "
"Account Settings."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Chiave API di produzione`: la chiave API di produzione nelle "
"Impostazioni account di EasyPost."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:87
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Label Format`: "
"Choose :guilabel:`PNG`, :guilabel:`PDF`, :guilabel:`ZPL`, "
"or :guilabel:`EPL2` from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Formato etichetta`: "
"scegli :guilabel:`PNG`, :guilabel:`PDF`, :guilabel:`ZPL` o :guilabel:`EPL2` "
"dal menu a discesa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:89
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Generate Return Label`: Select to automatically generate a return "
"label when validating the delivery."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Genera etichetta di reso`: seleziona per generare automaticamente "
"un'etichetta di reso quando convalidi la consegna."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:92
msgid ""
"Save the delivery method by clicking the :icon:`fa-cloud-"
"upload` :guilabel:`(Save manually)` icon."
msgstr ""
"Salva il metodo di consegna facendo clic sull'icona :icon:`fa-cloud-"
"upload` :guilabel:`Salva manualmente`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:94
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Load your Easypost carrier accounts` link under the API "
"keys."
msgstr ""
"Fare clic sul collegamento :guilabel:`Carica i tuoi account corriere "
"Easypost` sotto le chiavi API."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:96
msgid "Load the EasyPost carrier accounts into Odoo."
msgstr "Caricare gli account corriere EasyPost in Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:99
msgid ""
"The *Select a carrier* pop-up window opens. Select a shipping carrier from "
"the drop-down menu, then click :guilabel:`Select`."
msgstr ""
"Si apre la finestra pop-up *Seleziona un corriere*. Selezionare un corriere "
"di spedizione dal menu a discesa, quindi fare clic su :guilabel:`Seleziona`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:102
msgid ""
"After the carrier type has been selected, complete the :guilabel:`Default "
"Package Type` and :guilabel:`Default Service Level` fields."
msgstr ""
"Dopo aver selezionato il tipo di corriere, compilare i campi :guilabel:`Tipo "
"di pacco predefinito` e :guilabel:`Livello di servizio predefinito`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:105
msgid ""
"Select a package type and service level that should be used for the carrier."
msgstr ""
"Selezionare un tipo di pacco e un livello di servizio da utilizzare per il "
"corriere."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:109
msgid "Turn on the Easypost integration"
msgstr "Attivare l'integrazione Easypost"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:111
msgid ""
"After the EasyPost connection is set up, use the smart buttons at the top of "
"the form to publish, turn on production mode, or activate debug logging."
msgstr ""
"Dopo aver configurato la connessione EasyPost, utilizzare i pulsanti "
"intelligenti nella parte superiore del modulo per pubblicare, attivare la "
"modalità di produzione o attivare la registrazione di debug."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:114
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Unpublished/Published`: determines if this delivery method is "
"available on the user's **eCommerce** website."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Non pubblicato/Pubblicato`: determina se questo metodo di "
"consegna è disponibile sul sito web **E-commerce** dell'utente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:116
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Test Environment/Production Environment`: determines whether "
"label creation is for testing and cancelled immediately (Test) or generating "
"a real shipping label that is charged to the EasyPost account (Production)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Ambiente di test/Ambiente di produzione`: determina se la "
"creazione dell'etichetta è a scopo di test e viene annullata immediatamente "
"(Test) o genera un'etichetta di spedizione reale che viene addebitata "
"sull'account EasyPost (Produzione)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/easypost.rst:119
msgid ""
":guilabel:`No Debug/Debug Requests`: determines whether API requests and "
"responses are logged in Odoo (turn on **developer mode** and go "
"to :menuselection:`Settings app --> Technical --> Logging`)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Nessun debug/Debug richieste`: determina se le richieste e le "
"risposte API vengono registrate in Odoo (attivare la **modalità "
"sviluppatore** e andare in :menuselection:`App Impostazioni --> Tecnico --> "
"Registrazione`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:3
msgid "Envia.com integration"
msgstr "Integrazione Envia.com"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:5
msgid ""
"Envia.com is a shipping service that connects businesses with multiple "
"carriers in Odoo. Key features include:"
msgstr ""
"Envia.com è un servizio di spedizione che collega le aziende con più "
"corrieri in Odoo. Le caratteristiche principali includono:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:8
msgid ""
"**Multi-carrier & international shipping**: Compare rates across carriers "
"and select the best option for domestic or global shipments."
msgstr ""
"**Spedizioni multi-corriere e internazionali**: confrontare le tariffe tra i "
"corrieri e selezionare l'opzione migliore per spedizioni nazionali o globali."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:10
msgid ""
"**Automated label generation**: Generate shipping labels at order "
"confirmation."
msgstr ""
"**Generazione automatica di etichette**: generare etichette di spedizione "
"alla conferma dell'ordine."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:11
msgid ""
"**Real-time rate calculation**: Fetch rates based on package details and "
"destination."
msgstr ""
"**Calcolo tariffe in tempo reale**: recuperare le tariffe in base ai "
"dettagli del pacco e alla destinazione."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:14
msgid "Setup in Envia"
msgstr "Configurazione in Envia"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:16
msgid ""
"To integrate `Envia.com <https://www.envia.com>`_ with Odoo, first create an "
"account and activate the necessary shipping carriers. Then, obtain the API "
"credentials, which is used to connect Envia.com to the Odoo database."
msgstr ""
"Per integrare `Envia.com <https://www.envia.com>`_ con Odoo, creare prima un "
"account e attivare i corrieri necessari. Quindi, ottenere le credenziali "
"API, che vengono utilizzate per collegare Envia.com al database Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:21
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:13
msgid "Create an account and activate carriers"
msgstr "Crea un account e attiva i corrieri"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:23
msgid "Begin by going to `Envia.com <https://www.envia.com>`_."
msgstr "Inizia andando su `Envia.com <https://www.envia.com>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:25
msgid ""
"After signing in, in the left sidebar, click :menuselection:`Settings --> "
"Print Options and Carriers`. Next, select the country to set the currency "
"and display available shipping carriers."
msgstr ""
"Dopo aver effettuato l'accesso, nella barra laterale sinistra, fai clic "
"su :menuselection:`Impostazioni --> Opzioni di stampa e Corrieri`. "
"Successivamente, seleziona il paese per impostare la valuta e visualizzare i "
"corrieri disponibili."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:29
msgid ""
"When signing up, make sure to select the correct language **and** country in "
"the upper right-hand corner. This affects the currency of the account!"
msgstr ""
"Durante la registrazione, assicurati di selezionare la lingua **e** il paese "
"corretti nell'angolo in alto a destra. Questo influisce sulla valuta "
"dell'account!"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:32
msgid "Registry process in website with Envia.com."
msgstr "Processo di registrazione nel sito web con Envia.com."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:35
msgid ""
"After deciding on the desired carrier, click :guilabel:`Activate`, then "
"click :guilabel:`Services` to select the carrier's available shipping "
"options."
msgstr ""
"Dopo aver deciso il corriere desiderato, fai clic su :guilabel:`Attiva`, "
"quindi fai clic su :guilabel:`Servizi` per selezionare le opzioni di "
"spedizione disponibili del corriere."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:39
msgid ""
"Billing is always processed in the currency of the country that matches the "
"primary billing address. If the company operates in multiple countries, "
"consider creating separate accounts for each location."
msgstr ""
"La fatturazione viene sempre elaborata nella valuta del paese che "
"corrisponde all'indirizzo di fatturazione principale. Se l'azienda opera in "
"più paesi, considera la creazione di account separati per ciascuna sede."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:44
msgid ""
"Envia will send an SMS or WhatsApp message to confirm the email address and "
"phone number."
msgstr ""
"Envia invierà un messaggio SMS o WhatsApp per confermare l'indirizzo email e "
"il numero di telefono."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:46
msgid "Select carrier services."
msgstr "Seleziona i servizi del corriere."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:50
msgid "Generate Envia.com credentials"
msgstr "Genera le credenziali di Envia.com"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:52
msgid ""
"Go to `Envia.com <https://www.envia.com>`_, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Developers --> API Keys`, on the left menu, then "
"click :guilabel:`add` to generate a new key."
msgstr ""
"Vai su `Envia.com <https://www.envia.com>`_, naviga "
"su :menuselection:`Sviluppatori --> Chiavi API`, nel menu a sinistra, quindi "
"fai clic su :guilabel:`aggiungi` per generare una nuova chiave."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:55
msgid ""
"This key is required to authenticate Odoo's connection with Envia.com. "
"Retrieve it at any time by returning to the :guilabel:`API Keys` section."
msgstr ""
"Questa chiave è necessaria per autenticare la connessione di Odoo con "
"Envia.com. Recuperala in qualsiasi momento tornando alla "
"sezione :guilabel:`Chiavi API`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:58
msgid "API Keys in Envia.com."
msgstr "Chiavi API in Envia.com."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:62
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:81
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/starshipit_shipping.rst:90
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/ups_credentials.rst:165
msgid "Setup in Odoo"
msgstr "Installazione in Odoo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:64
msgid ""
":ref:`Install <general/install>` the :guilabel:`Envia Shipping` "
"(`delivery_envia`) module, and proceed to the following sections to "
"configure the integration in Odoo."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Installa <general/install>` il modulo :guilabel:`Spedizione Envia` "
"(`delivery_envia`) e procedi alle sezioni seguenti per configurare "
"l'integrazione in Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:68
msgid "Envia.com shipping connector configuration"
msgstr "Configurazione del connettore di spedizione Envia.com"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:70
msgid ""
"After activating the Envia.com connector, create a delivery method by going "
"to :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Delivery Methods` and "
"click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"Dopo aver attivato il connettore Envia.com, crea un metodo di consegna "
"andando su :menuselection:`Magazzino --> Configurazione --> Metodi di "
"consegna` e fai clic su :guilabel:`Nuovo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:73
msgid "Fill out the following form fields:"
msgstr "Compila i seguenti campi del modulo:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:75
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Shipping Method`: Name of the shipping method, e.g. `Envia.com`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Metodo di spedizione`: Nome del metodo di spedizione, ad es. "
"`Envia.com`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:76
msgid ":guilabel:`Provider`: Select :guilabel:`Envia` from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Fornitore`: Seleziona :guilabel:`Envia` dal menu a tendina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:77
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Delivery Product`: The product listed on the sales order as the "
"delivery charge. A specific delivery product for Envia.com must be created."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Prodotto di consegna`: Il prodotto elencato nell'ordine di "
"vendita come costo di consegna. Deve essere creato un prodotto di consegna "
"specifico per Envia.com."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:79
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Envia Configuration` tab, enter the :guilabel:`Envia "
"Production Access Token`."
msgstr ""
"Nella scheda :guilabel:`Configurazione Envia`, inserisci il :guilabel:`Token "
"di accesso produzione Envia`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:80
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Envia Configuration` tab, enter the :guilabel:`Envia "
"Sandbox Access Token`."
msgstr ""
"Nella scheda :guilabel:`Configurazione Envia`, inserisci il :guilabel:`Token "
"di accesso sandbox Envia`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:81
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Insurance percentage`: If insurance is needed, place a percentage "
"of the value to insure. If not, leave it as 0. Keep in mind that the "
"insurance price is calculated only after the label has been generated, "
"including for LTL shipments."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Percentuale assicurazione`: se è necessaria un'assicurazione, "
"inserisci una percentuale del valore da assicurare. In caso contrario, "
"lasciala a 0. Tieni presente che il prezzo dell'assicurazione viene "
"calcolato solo dopo la generazione dell'etichetta, anche per le spedizioni "
"LTL."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:86
msgid ""
"It is mandatory to fill both the production and sandbox tokens, but it could "
"be left as a random character as it is not validated at this point."
msgstr ""
"È obbligatorio compilare sia il token di produzione che quello sandbox, ma "
"può essere lasciato come carattere casuale poiché non viene convalidato in "
"questa fase."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:89
msgid "Additional considerations for the :guilabel:`Envia Default Package`:"
msgstr "Considerazioni aggiuntive per il :guilabel:`Pacco predefinito Envia`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:91
msgid ""
"The package is specified in :guilabel:`mm` and :guilabel:`kg`. The weight "
"refers to the container itself, not its contents. Leave the weight as `0` if "
"no weight is reported, and set the max weight to `0` if there is no "
"specified limit."
msgstr ""
"Il pacco è specificato in :guilabel:`mm` e :guilabel:`kg`. Il peso si "
"riferisce al contenitore stesso, non al suo contenuto. Lascia il peso a `0` "
"se non viene riportato alcun peso e imposta il peso massimo a `0` se non è "
"specificato alcun limite."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:94
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Envia Package Type`: Set to :guilabel:`Box` by default. Ensure "
"the correct type is selected, as it affects the available carriers and "
"options displayed, which vary depending on this selection."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tipo di pacco Envia`: impostato su :guilabel:`Scatola` per "
"impostazione predefinita. Assicurati che sia selezionato il tipo corretto, "
"poiché influisce sui corrieri e sulle opzioni disponibili visualizzati, che "
"variano a seconda di questa selezione."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:98
msgid ""
"Once previous fields are properly set, navigate to the :guilabel:`Envia "
"Configuration` tab, and in the :guilabel:`Envia.com Service Name` field, "
"click the :icon:`fa-refresh` :guilabel:`(refresh)` icon to sync the "
"carriers. In the pop-up window that appears, select a carrier and a service "
"level from the list."
msgstr ""
"Una volta impostati correttamente i campi precedenti, vai alla "
"scheda :guilabel:`Configurazione Envia` e nel campo :guilabel:`Nome servizio "
"Envia.com`, fai clic sull'icona :icon:`fa-refresh` :guilabel:`Aggiorna` per "
"sincronizzare i corrieri. Nella finestra popup che appare, seleziona un "
"corriere e un livello di servizio dall'elenco."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:103
msgid "Envia.com carrier and services popup."
msgstr "Popup corriere e servizi Envia.com."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:107
msgid ""
"Envia keeps the main currency of the account fixed. In order to provide more "
"precise conversions for the costs of shipping, specify the currency that is "
"set for the account on Envia. If necessary, Odoo offers the option to change "
"the country. By default it uses the country associated with the company."
msgstr ""
"Envia mantiene fissa la valuta principale dell'account. Per fornire "
"conversioni più precise per i costi di spedizione, specifica la valuta "
"impostata per l'account su Envia. Se necessario, Odoo offre l'opzione per "
"cambiare il paese. Per impostazione predefinita utilizza il paese associato "
"all'azienda."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:113
msgid ""
"If more than one shipping option is needed, create more shipping methods in "
"Odoo and modify any parameter like the package, carrier, or service."
msgstr ""
"Se è necessaria più di un'opzione di spedizione, crea più metodi di "
"spedizione in Odoo e modifica qualsiasi parametro come il pacco, il corriere "
"o il servizio."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:119
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:256
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:148
msgid "Shipping information"
msgstr "Informazioni di spedizione"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:121
msgid ""
"To use Envia.com to generate shipping labels, the following information "
"**must** be filled out accurately and completely in Odoo:"
msgstr ""
"Per utilizzare Envia.com per generare etichette di spedizione, le seguenti "
"informazioni **devono** essere compilate in modo accurato e completo in Odoo:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:124
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:261
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/shiprocket.rst:153
msgid ""
"**Customer information**: When creating a quotation, ensure the "
"selected :guilabel:`Customer` has a valid phone number, email address, and "
"shipping address."
msgstr ""
"**Informazioni cliente**: quando crei un preventivo, assicurati che "
"il :guilabel:`Cliente` selezionato abbia un numero di telefono, un indirizzo "
"email e un indirizzo di spedizione validi."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:127
#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/sendcloud_shipping.rst:264
msgid ""
"To verify, select the :guilabel:`Customer` field to open their contact page. "
"Here, add their shipping address in the :guilabel:`Contact` field, along "
"with their :guilabel:`Mobile` number and :guilabel:`Email` address."
msgstr ""
"Per verificare, seleziona il campo :guilabel:`Cliente` per aprire la "
"relativa pagina contatto. Qui, aggiungi il suo indirizzo di spedizione nel "
"campo :guilabel:`Contatto`, insieme al numero di :guilabel:`Cellulare` e "
"all'indirizzo :guilabel:`Email`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:130
msgid ""
"**Product weight**: Ensure all products in a delivery order have a "
"specified :guilabel:`Weight` in the :guilabel:`Inventory` tab of their "
"product form. Refer to the :ref:`Product weight section <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/configure-weight>` of this article for detailed "
"instructions."
msgstr ""
"**Peso prodotto**: assicurati che tutti i prodotti in un ordine di consegna "
"abbiano un :guilabel:`Peso` specificato nella scheda :guilabel:`Magazzino` "
"del relativo modulo prodotto. Consulta la :ref:`sezione Peso prodotto "
"<inventory/shipping_receiving/configure-weight>` di questo articolo per "
"istruzioni dettagliate."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:133
msgid ""
"**Warehouse address**: By default all packages are sent from the specified "
"address in the warehouse, make sure to set the address for correct label "
"generation."
msgstr ""
"**Indirizzo magazzino**: per impostazione predefinita tutti i pacchi vengono "
"inviati dall'indirizzo specificato nel magazzino, assicurati di impostare "
"l'indirizzo per la corretta generazione dell'etichetta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/envia_shipping.rst:137
