"to another, can be automatically printed in Odoo by following these steps:"
msgstr ""
"Un *documento di esportazione*, richiesto dalla dogana per spedire pacchi da "
"un paese a un altro, può essere stampato automaticamente in Odoo seguendo "
"questi passaggi:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:291
msgid ""
"Tick the :guilabel:`Export Documents` checkbox in the :ref:`operation type "
"settings <inventory/shipping_receiving/print_setup>`."
msgstr ""
"Spunta la casella :guilabel:`Documenti di esportazione` "
"nelle :ref:`impostazioni del tipo di operazione <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/print_setup>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:294
msgid "Assign the export document to the printer."
msgstr "Assegna il documento di esportazione alla stampante."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/print_on_validation.rst:296
msgid ""
"Similar to the printer assignment instructions for carrier labels, "
"after :ref:`connecting a compatible printer to Odoo <inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/configure-printers>`, go to :menuselection:`Inventory --> "
"Configuration --> Manage Printers`, and select the desired printer."
