msgstr ":icon:`oi-view-pivot` Pivot"

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_analysis.rst:126
msgid ""
"The :ref:`pivot view <reporting/using-pivot>` displays the "
"selected :ref:`Measures <inventory/warehouses_storage/moves-analysis-"
"measures>` in a table with two axes, which makes it most suitable for "
"comparing quantities and values by time period, product, category, or "
"location. This is the view used by the :ref:`Aging report <inventory/"
"warehouses_storage/moves-analysis-aging-report>` in :guilabel:`Favorites`."
msgstr ""
"La :ref:`vista pivot <reporting/using-pivot>` visualizza le :ref:`Misure "
"<inventory/warehouses_storage/moves-analysis-measures>` selezionate in una "
"tabella con due assi, rendendola ideale per confrontare quantità e valori "
"per periodo di tempo, prodotto, categoria o ubicazione. Questa è la vista "
"utilizzata dal :ref:`Report anzianità <inventory/warehouses_storage/moves-"
"analysis-aging-report>` in :guilabel:`Preferiti`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_analysis.rst:132
msgid ""
"By default, rows are grouped by month and columns are grouped by operation "
"type. Click the :icon:`fa-plus-square` :guilabel:`Total` icon on a row or "
"column header to select a different :ref:`grouping <inventory/"
"warehouses_storage/moves-analysis-search-options>`."
msgstr ""
"Per impostazione predefinita, le righe sono raggruppate per mese e le "
"colonne per tipo di operazione. Fare clic sull'icona :icon:`fa-plus-"
"square` :guilabel:`Totale` su un'intestazione di riga o colonna per "
"selezionare un diverso :ref:`raggruppamento <inventory/warehouses_storage/"
"moves-analysis-search-options>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/moves_analysis.rst:136
